        <h2>Curious Pasture Pigs</h2>
        <p>
          Our Kune Kune pigs are friendly, compact, and full of personality. They are natural foragers that spend time outdoors rooting through soil, grazing, exploring, and interacting with the rest of the herd.
        </p>
        <p>
          Pigs are handled regularly and raised around people, so many are comfortable and curious when visitors are nearby. They still have individual temperaments, and all interactions are calm, supervised, and guided by the animal's comfort.
        </p>
